(2832052, 394806, 43774, '<td valign="top">Very cool! Love the line leading to the circle, the textures and colours are also great. I can''t tell if I am looking down at a drain in the floor or up to a hole in the ceiling......oh, now I can see faint grid lines inside the circle, I am guessing this is a drain. If you had flipped the image the line/crack in the floor would make it look like the circle was a swinging pendulum (but that''s physics, right?). In any case, I love this and am giving it a 10 and it''s going in my favourites.</td>', 'Very cool! Love the line leading to the circle, the textures and colours are also great. I can''t tell if I am looking down at a drain in the floor or up to a hole in the ceiling......oh, now I can see faint grid lines inside the circle, I am guessing this is a drain. If you had flipped the image the line/crack in the floor would make it look like the circle was a swinging pendulum (but that''s physics, right?). In any case, I love this and am giving it a 10 and it''s going in my favourites.', '2006-09-13 15:03:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2832054, 394942, 43774, '<td valign="top">Haha!! That''s too funny and your title is perfect!</td>', 'Haha!! That''s too funny and your title is perfect!', '2006-09-13 15:03:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2832055, 394981, 64612, '<td valign="top">nice focus and shiny</td>', 'nice focus and shiny', '2006-09-13 15:03:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2832057, 395186, 43774, '<td valign="top">Very nice setup although I think it could benefit from better lighting and a bit of sharpening, it looks a bit soft now.</td>', 'Very nice setup although I think it could benefit from better lighting and a bit of sharpening, it looks a bit soft now.', '2006-09-13 15:04:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2832058, 395347, 43774, '<td valign="top">Not fond of the composition, I think it would be better if the entire watch face were in the frame and not chopped off.</td>', 'Not fond of the composition, I think it would be better if the entire watch face were in the frame and not chopped off.', '2006-09-13 15:04:43.000000', NULL, 1),
