(2832075, 395204, 43774, '<td valign="top">A bit contrasty but I think that works for this image. The shadow is really neat and complements the rest of the lines and shapes in the photo.</td>', 'A bit contrasty but I think that works for this image. The shadow is really neat and complements the rest of the lines and shapes in the photo.', '2006-09-13 15:09:17.000000', NULL, 1),
