(2832078, 395037, 62642, '<td valign="top">Cool...I wonder if this would be even better if the triangle appeared over the horizon, by shooting from a lower angle?</td>', 'Cool...I wonder if this would be even better if the triangle appeared over the horizon, by shooting from a lower angle?', '2006-09-13 15:09:52.000000', NULL, 1),
