(2835909, 395411, 27072, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture, nice lighting &amp; composition, good use of rule of 3rd. Well done. Tho, i have a hard time putting it in relation with the challenge.</td>', 'Very nice picture, nice lighting & composition, good use of rule of 3rd. Well done. Tho, i have a hard time putting it in relation with the challenge.', '2006-09-14 21:22:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2835919, 393648, 27072, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, i would have prefer the nest less in the middle horizontaly tho... In fact, I see that all the picture is going perfectly frame to match all the pipes equally, and I would have like more «disturbance» in the framing. Nevertheless, it still a very good capture.</td>', 'Nice picture, i would have prefer the nest less in the middle horizontaly tho... In fact, I see that all the picture is going perfectly frame to match all the pipes equally, and I would have like more «disturbance» in the framing. Nevertheless, it still a very good capture.', '2006-09-14 21:25:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2835922, 394982, 27072, '<td valign="top">Its a good start, now i guess a better use of the rule of 3rd and having it done darker would have been more stunning...</td>', 'Its a good start, now i guess a better use of the rule of 3rd and having it done darker would have been more stunning...', '2006-09-14 21:27:25.000000', NULL, 1),
