(2845514, 392412, 30049, '<td valign="top">Very nice lines and a fun to look at image.  I wish the top extruding piece could be in focus as well, but I''m sure it''s tough to get DOF all the way thru the image from the distance you were positioned from the subject.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Very nice lines and a fun to look at image.  I wish the top extruding piece could be in focus as well, but I''m sure it''s tough to get DOF all the way thru the image from the distance you were positioned from the subject.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-09-18 16:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2845519, 395348, 30049, '<td valign="top">Good point.  Certainly some engineering design and angles were needed to put a blueprint together for this.  I like the color in the sky and the silhouette of the windmill.  Did you try to get a lower angle to get that (powerline?) and fence out of view?  That''s a minor bummer, but not so much that it kills the image.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'Good point.  Certainly some engineering design and angles were needed to put a blueprint together for this.  I like the color in the sky and the silhouette of the windmill.  Did you try to get a lower angle to get that (powerline?) and fence out of view?  That''s a minor bummer, but not so much that it kills the image.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-09-18 16:59:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2845671, 393234, 24764, '<td valign="top">Wonderful prespective, this really ought to be part of film on a widescreen.</td>', 'Wonderful prespective, this really ought to be part of film on a widescreen.', '2006-09-18 18:16:48.000000', NULL, 1),
