(2849330, 394202, 9581, '<td valign="top">WOW!</td>', 'WOW!', '2006-09-20 00:58:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2849352, 391949, 63716, '<td valign="top">I didn''t expect this one to do as well as it did... I had my doubts when I posted it. I had another shot on the Chemistry theme which I much preferred, but it was just a snapshot. This one was the result of a special trip at night on a cold night so I posted it in honour of the effort!!<br/> <br/>I see one generous person gave me a 10! Thank you whoever you are, I''d like to shake your hand!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-09-20 00:13:54.</i></td>', 'I didn''t expect this one to do as well as it did... I had my doubts when I posted it. I had another shot on the Chemistry theme which I much preferred, but it was just a snapshot. This one was the result of a special trip at night on a cold night so I posted it in honour of the effort!! I see one generous person gave me a 10! Thank you whoever you are, I''d like to shake your hand!', '2006-09-20 01:12:46.000000', '2006-09-20 01:13:54.000000', 0),
(2849356, 393421, 40718, '<td valign="top">Way to go Ben!</td>', 'Way to go Ben!', '2006-09-20 01:14:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(2849359, 393421, 29009, '<td valign="top">Yay Ben!  I''m so pleased for you...it''s a great shot and very deserving of it''s placement.  Couldn''t be more thrilled to see your talent rewarded!</td>', 'Yay Ben!  I''m so pleased for you...it''s a great shot and very deserving of it''s placement.  Couldn''t be more thrilled to see your talent rewarded!', '2006-09-20 01:14:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(2849363, 393234, 60505, '<td valign="top">Great clear picture. Love the gradient in the blue sky fom dark to light. Love the architectural detail in the boxes on top of the arches and the perspective generated by their recession.</td>', 'Great clear picture. Love the gradient in the blue sky fom dark to light. Love the architectural detail in the boxes on top of the arches and the perspective generated by their recession.', '2006-09-20 01:15:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(2849379, 393421, 60505, '<td valign="top">Congrats! Super sky coloration and very interesting and complex shape!</td>', 'Congrats! Super sky coloration and very interesting and complex shape!', '2006-09-20 01:17:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(2849382, 395260, 60505, '<td valign="top">Just Beautiful. Congrats!</td>', 'Just Beautiful. Congrats!', '2006-09-20 01:18:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(2849397, 394701, 50641, '<td valign="top">It''s neat to see another of these suckers - the ones in my garden aren''t nearly as colorful.  <a href="//dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=389825" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=389825</a> <br/> <br/>Nice colors, good choice for this challenge. The focus-thing will come, just keep practicing until you''re just about cross-eyed :P<br/> <br/>p.s. Look out, he bites.</td>', 'It''s neat to see another of these suckers - the ones in my garden aren''t nearly as colorful.  //dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=389825  Nice colors, good choice for this challenge. The focus-thing will come, just keep practicing until you''re just about cross-eyed :P p.s. Look out, he bites.', '2006-09-20 01:20:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(2849401, 393421, 36371, '<td valign="top">Wow! I loved this one! Way to go!</td>', 'Wow! I loved this one! Way to go!', '2006-09-20 01:22:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(2849403, 393421, 5112, '<td valign="top">Too lazy to clean the sensor, eh?  He, he, he, that''s what you get.  Anyway.  Many congrats, this looks almost like music.  Very beautiful.</td>', 'Too lazy to clean the sensor, eh?  He, he, he, that''s what you get.  Anyway.  Many congrats, this looks almost like music.  Very beautiful.', '2006-09-20 01:22:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(2849421, 393421, 5705, '<td valign="top">Congrats ben on your ribbon, been 2 years!</td>', 'Congrats ben on your ribbon, been 2 years!', '2006-09-20 01:26:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(2849427, 393191, 14620, '<td valign="top">Oh So Close!!!  Always the bridesmaid, never the bride. :-)  Fantastic shot and way to improve on an already outstanding photo Eric.</td>', 'Oh So Close!!!  Always the bridesmaid, never the bride. :-)  Fantastic shot and way to improve on an already outstanding photo Eric.', '2006-09-20 01:27:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(2849430, 395202, 3936, '<td valign="top">Critique Club Review:<br/> <br/>Very Nice Photo.<br/> <br/>Focus and depth of field are excellent.  Color is done well.<br/> <br/>I think you''ve already heard the major complaint over, and over.<br/> <br/>I like the tones of of the lamp, book and pencil.  But the rest is just too dark.  The rest is so dark that the book and pencil become almost disconnected from the lamp.  Together they almost seem to float in space.  As a mood or dream piece, this could work.  But then I would expect to see a softer focus or warmer background.  <br/> <br/>For some reason, this almost seems to be a piece about death.  Perhaps because of the darkness, or maybe it is just me.<br/> <br/>Either way, this is still a very good photo and congratulations on finishing in the top 30.</td>', 'Critique Club Review: Very Nice Photo. Focus and depth of field are excellent.  Color is done well. I think you''ve already heard the major complaint over, and over. I like the tones of of the lamp, book and pencil.  But the rest is just too dark.  The rest is so dark that the book and pencil become almost disconnected from the lamp.  Together they almost seem to float in space.  As a mood or dream piece, this could work.  But then I would expect to see a softer focus or warmer background.   For some reason, this almost seems to be a piece about death.  Perhaps because of the darkness, or maybe it is just me. Either way, this is still a very good photo and congratulations on finishing in the top 30.', '2006-09-20 01:27:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(2849444, 392995, 15711, '<td valign="top">Look at you! Top 5. Congrats.</td>', 'Look at you! Top 5. Congrats.', '2006-09-20 01:31:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(2849450, 394785, 31637, '<td valign="top">WOW..gorgeous shot...and spider ! looks platinum. BTW, did you use a flash here? i have a similair shot .</td>', 'WOW..gorgeous shot...and spider ! looks platinum. BTW, did you use a flash here? i have a similair shot .', '2006-09-20 01:33:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(2849463, 392995, 23430, '<td valign="top">Top 5 and PB. Way to go June. Great shot.</td>', 'Top 5 and PB. Way to go June. Great shot.', '2006-09-20 01:36:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(2849501, 392995, 64176, '<td valign="top">i was one of the web admirers who gave this a 10.  this is an incredible shot!  congrats on 5th place!</td>', 'i was one of the web admirers who gave this a 10.  this is an incredible shot!  congrats on 5th place!', '2006-09-20 01:44:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(2849511, 395252, 24486, '<td valign="top">I thought this was a great concept &amp; I think it should have finished a lot higher than it did.</td>', 'I thought this was a great concept & I think it should have finished a lot higher than it did.', '2006-09-20 01:47:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(2849556, 395055, 48560, '<td valign="top">I''m amazed at how "balanced" this photo is!<br/>The main subject, unquestionably is the ceiling with all the strong geometrical lines, but what also fancied me a lot is the little signs at the bottom of your shot - nice.<br/>Congrats on the top 20 placement!<br/></td>', 'I''m amazed at how "balanced" this photo is!The main subject, unquestionably is the ceiling with all the strong geometrical lines, but what also fancied me a lot is the little signs at the bottom of your shot - nice.Congrats on the top 20 placement!', '2006-09-20 01:58:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(2849573, 395260, 3214, '<td valign="top">Fully deserving of first place IMO, but as long as it ribboned...I particularly like the processing/tones and the juxtaposition of hardness and softness.</td>', 'Fully deserving of first place IMO, but as long as it ribboned...I particularly like the processing/tones and the juxtaposition of hardness and softness.', '2006-09-20 02:00:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(2849581, 393421, 3214, '<td valign="top">There''s a reason you were an early favorite of mine here.  ;-)  Congrats, the comp on this is so interesting, so many shapes to explore.</td>', 'There''s a reason you were an early favorite of mine here.  ;-)  Congrats, the comp on this is so interesting, so many shapes to explore.', '2006-09-20 02:02:18.000000', NULL, 0),
