(2849720, 393421, 30861, '<td valign="top">Wow! Your first ribbon since I joined! Welcome back to the winner''s circle at last! The lighting here is exceptionally good, what we used to call "fully descriptive" in architectural photography-speak.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-09-20 01:45:03.</i></td>', 'Wow! Your first ribbon since I joined! Welcome back to the winner''s circle at last! The lighting here is exceptionally good, what we used to call "fully descriptive" in architectural photography-speak.', '2006-09-20 02:44:05.000000', '2006-09-20 02:45:03.000000', 0),
