(2849748, 395319, 22934, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments folks, I''m surprised I did as well as I did for my first submission.  <br/> <br/>@manhan92 Kawasaki Rose is the name of the origami model pictured.<br/> <br/>@KarenNfld It probably could''ve been a bit brighter, but the easier solution would have been to use a lighter paper color.<br/> <br/>@fencekicker You are correct the paper underneath is an unfolded rose.</td>', 'Thanks for the comments folks, I''m surprised I did as well as I did for my first submission.   @manhan92 Kawasaki Rose is the name of the origami model pictured. @KarenNfld It probably could''ve been a bit brighter, but the easier solution would have been to use a lighter paper color. @fencekicker You are correct the paper underneath is an unfolded rose.', '2006-09-20 02:52:24.000000', NULL, 0),
