(2849908, 391949, 63716, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by spartacus9:</b></div><hr/><i> good find and great photo.  did you shoot w/ existing lighting or add to it? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Just available light. I shot Raw and bracketed exposure to get the best one.</td>', 'Originally posted by spartacus9: good find and great photo.  did you shoot w/ existing lighting or add to it?   Just available light. I shot Raw and bracketed exposure to get the best one.', '2006-09-20 04:48:23.000000', NULL, 0),
