(2852224, 392412, 53147, '<td valign="top">Good shot here. The lighting is nice and the subject is interesting. The green on the outer edge of the mushroom is a bit odd - desating the green channel may have cleared that up. And the pic could be sharper as well, but this is still a nice shot that scored pretty good. Cant complain about top 50 out of 200. I didnt vote in this one but I would have probably given 6-7 depending on my mood at the time.</td>', 'Good shot here. The lighting is nice and the subject is interesting. The green on the outer edge of the mushroom is a bit odd - desating the green channel may have cleared that up. And the pic could be sharper as well, but this is still a nice shot that scored pretty good. Cant complain about top 50 out of 200. I didnt vote in this one but I would have probably given 6-7 depending on my mood at the time.', '2006-09-20 20:37:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(2852233, 394680, 38234, '<td valign="top">Thanks PapaBob:-)  It''s not my first and it definitely won''t be my last mistake LOL    Hopefully there''ll be quite a bit of time to the next one here though!!</td>', 'Thanks PapaBob:-)  It''s not my first and it definitely won''t be my last mistake LOL    Hopefully there''ll be quite a bit of time to the next one here though!!', '2006-09-20 20:39:54.000000', NULL, 0),
