(2852627, 393555, 27605, '<td valign="top">Good eye Barry to see that spider!  I don''t think I would have myself.  Wonder if you could isolate the area of the spider and bump the red channel way up to good effect...  Cool shot btw :o)</td>', 'Good eye Barry to see that spider!  I don''t think I would have myself.  Wonder if you could isolate the area of the spider and bump the red channel way up to good effect...  Cool shot btw :o)', '2006-09-20 23:07:35.000000', NULL, 0),
