(2855902, 395251, 48890, '<td valign="top">I like this image.  It''s pure composition, with very little else.  I don''t like the jaggies along the middle rope, which, undoubtedly, comes from the extreme crop, followed by aggressive sharpening.</td>', 'I like this image.  It''s pure composition, with very little else.  I don''t like the jaggies along the middle rope, which, undoubtedly, comes from the extreme crop, followed by aggressive sharpening.', '2006-09-22 02:54:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(2856339, 395251, 50695, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by agenkin:</b></div><hr/><i> I like this image.  It''s pure composition, with very little else.  I don''t like the jaggies along the middle rope, which, undoubtedly, comes from the extreme crop, followed by aggressive sharpening. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>You are correct! Like you said, I sacrificed everything for composition. And I think grain is sexy.</td>', 'Originally posted by agenkin: I like this image.  It''s pure composition, with very little else.  I don''t like the jaggies along the middle rope, which, undoubtedly, comes from the extreme crop, followed by aggressive sharpening.   You are correct! Like you said, I sacrificed everything for composition. And I think grain is sexy.', '2006-09-22 10:17:12.000000', NULL, 0),
